# LLM Orchestration Platform — Setup Guide

## Overview

This project supports:
- GitHub repository ingestion
- AST-based code intelligence
- Ollama local LLM integration
- Chroma vector database
- RAG pipelines
- Multi-agent orchestration
- Redis queues
- WebSockets

---

# Clone Repository

```bash
git clone <YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL>

cd llm-orchestration-platform
```

---

# Install Ollama

## Windows

Download:

https://ollama.com/download/windows

## Mac

```bash
brew install ollama
```

## Linux

```bash
curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh
```

---

# Start Ollama

```bash
ollama serve
```

---

# Pull Models

## Chat Model

```bash
ollama pull llama3.1
```

## Embedding Model

```bash
ollama pull nomic-embed-text
```

---

# Install MongoDB

Download:

https://www.mongodb.com/try/download/community

Start MongoDB:

```bash
mongod
```

---

# Install Redis

## Docker

```bash
docker run -d --name redis -p 6379:6379 redis
```

---

# Install ChromaDB

```bash
pip install chromadb
```

Run:

```bash
chroma run --host localhost --port 8000
```

---

# Backend Setup

Navigate:

```bash
cd apps/api
```

Install:

```bash
npm install
```

---

# Create Backend Environment File

Create:

```text
apps/api/.env
```

Add:

```env
PORT=4000

MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/llm-orchestration

OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434

CHROMA_URL=http://localhost:8000

REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
```

---

# Run Backend

```bash
npm run dev
```

Expected:

```text
MongoDB connected
API running on 4000
```

Backend URL:

```text
http://localhost:4000
```

---

# Frontend Setup

Open new terminal:

```bash
cd apps/frontend
```

Install:

```bash
npm install
```

Run:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Frontend URL:

```text
http://localhost:5173
```

---

# Running Services

| Service | URL |
|---|---|
| Frontend | http://localhost:5173 |
| Backend API | http://localhost:4000 |
| Ollama | http://localhost:11434 |
| ChromaDB | http://localhost:8000 |
| MongoDB | mongodb://localhost:27017 |
| Redis | localhost:6379 |

---

# Test APIs

## Health

```bash
curl http://localhost:4000/api/health
```

## GitHub

```bash
curl http://localhost:4000/api/github/octocat
```

## Repository Ingestion

```bash
curl --location "http://localhost:4000/api/repositories/ingest" \
--header "Content-Type: application/json" \
--data '{
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/vercel/ms.git"
}'
```

## RAG Query

```bash
curl --location "http://localhost:4000/api/rag/query" \
--header "Content-Type: application/json" \
--data '{
  "repo": "repo_ms",
  "question": "Explain middleware"
}'
```

